type: software
title: "ActinoScope: From bacterial genomes to enzymes and natural products"
authors:
  - given-names: "Imene"
    family-names: "Maallem"
    affiliation: "Floret Center for Advanced Genomics and Bioinformatics Research, Nigeria"
abstract: >-
